*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% A small driver file shaped like hplip's, for tests
*ModelName: "HP DeskJet 2700 series"
*ColorDevice: True
*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*DefaultPageSize: Letter
*PageSize Letter/Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Photo4x6.FB/4x6in Borderless: "<</PageSize[288 432]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Photo4x6/4x6in: "<</PageSize[288 432]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize
*ImageableArea Letter/Letter: "18 36 594 783"
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "18 36 577 833"
*ImageableArea Photo4x6.FB/4x6in Borderless: "0 0 288 432"
*ImageableArea Photo4x6/4x6in: "9 9 279 423"
*PaperDimension Letter/Letter: "612 792"
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595 842"
*PaperDimension Photo4x6.FB/4x6in Borderless: "288 432"
*PaperDimension Photo4x6/4x6in: "288 432"
*OpenUI *ColorModel/Output Mode: PickOne
*DefaultColorModel: RGB
*ColorModel RGB/Color: ""
*ColorModel KGray/Grayscale: ""
*CloseUI: *ColorModel
*OpenUI *MediaType/Media Type: PickOne
*DefaultMediaType: Plain
*MediaType Plain/Plain Paper: ""
*MediaType Glossy/HP Advanced Photo Paper: ""
*MediaType Transparency/Transparency Film: ""
*CloseUI: *MediaType
*OpenUI *OutputMode/Print Quality: PickOne
*DefaultOutputMode: Normal
*OutputMode FastDraft/Fast Draft: ""
*OutputMode Normal/Normal: ""
*OutputMode Best/Best: ""
*CloseUI: *OutputMode
*OpenUI *Duplex/2-Sided Printing: PickOne
*DefaultDuplex: None
*Duplex None/Off: ""
*Duplex DuplexNoTumble/Long Edge (Standard): ""
*Duplex DuplexTumble/Short Edge (Flip): ""
*CloseUI: *Duplex
